 doc/getting-started.rst | 26 +++++++++++++++++++++
 tests/meson.build       |  3 ++-
 tests/umpf-range-diff   | 48 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 umpf                    | 52 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 5 files changed, 128 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
